@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@alice = alice:alice-demo-pass
@bob = bob:bob-demo-pass

### Public catalog
GET {{base}}/api/books?page=0&size=20

### Search by title or author
GET {{base}}/api/books?q=java

### Book detail
GET {{base}}/api/books/2

### Borrow; copy the returned id into the return request below
POST {{base}}/api/loans
Authorization: Basic {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"bookId": 2}

### Current loans
GET {{base}}/api/me/loans
Authorization: Basic {{alice}}

### Bob cannot borrow while Alice holds the only license
POST {{base}}/api/loans
Authorization: Basic {{bob}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"bookId": 2}

### Replace 1 with the actual returned loan id; repeat to verify idempotency
PUT {{base}}/api/loans/1/return
Authorization: Basic {{alice}}

### Ready for traffic, including a database check
GET {{base}}/actuator/health/readiness
